(* for each any-state law, the
   common.h functions its harness unit contains (`hc4_ids_<law>`, computed from src/harness/<law>/code.v) and their
   specifications `hc4_G_<law>` = hc4_specs.v's v4 specifications where they exist, else hc_specs3.v's (hc_G3_all:
   unchanged functions; hc_select takes the FIRST specification of an identifier).  The common.h piece of a law:
   `piece_ok [u_h4_<law>] (hc4_imports x25519 aead_enc aead_dec xaead_enc xaead_dec CSw) (hc4_G_<law> ...)`
   (hc4_bodies.v, to come), whose imports are the environment, the lower pieces' interfaces and protocol4's prot_G4. *)
